cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use f-LENNS, please cite the preprint below."
title: "f-LENNS: functional Localization Enhancement via Neural-Net Sharpening"
abstract: >-
  AI-based super-resolution of functional MRI to 1 mm isotropic resolution,
  trained exclusively on domain-randomized synthetic data so that a single
  pretrained model generalizes across field strengths, pulse sequences,
  resolutions and experimental paradigms without retraining.
type: software
